# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# cpu_lab / qlora_lab: derived artifacts.
#
# Everything excluded below is reproducible on a new machine by running
#   python cpu_lab/bootstrap.py
# so it must NOT be committed:
#   - venvs        : contain absolute paths, must be rebuilt anyway
#   - model weights: re-download from hf-mirror, then convert to DCP
#   - run logs     : per-rank .log files; the numbers that matter are
#                    distilled into cpu_lab/reports/ and cpu_lab/MIGRATION.md
#
# Hard rule: GitHub's free LFS quota is 10 GiB storage / 10 GiB monthly
# bandwidth, and the weights alone are ~6.6 GiB.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

.venv/
qlora_lab/.venv/
venv/

cpu_lab/checkpoints/
cpu_lab/hf/
qlora_lab/hf/
qlora_lab/model/
qlora_lab/runs/
*.safetensors
*.distcp

cpu_lab/logs*/
.hf_cache/

# scratch files written by ad-hoc probes
cpu_lab/_*.txt
cpu_lab/_probe_*.py
